+## The four emphasized claims
+
+1. **Real same-PR rejection/correction (#4501) — confirmed as mechanics, not as acceptance.**
+   Both commits are GitHub-verified with the required fingerprint and identity; the correction
+   was pushed to the same PR with no duplicate. The corrected commit received **no**
+   authoritative checker verdict, and the PR was closed unmerged as a first-proof race loss
+   to merged rival #4471 (unsigned). It is correct to credit nothing to this PR.
+
+2. **Genuine GPG-signed ottojung publication — confirmed.**
+   Real merged PR #9466 and real PRs #4501/#4678/#4609/#12919 all carry `ottojung` author
+   and committer, `Otto Jung <otto.jung@vauplace.com>`, and GitHub-verified signatures made
+   with the prescribed subkey. The limitation is provenance of the key listing and the
+   unverified-email sub-item, not the observed signatures.
+
+3. **Authoritative checked acceptance and public credit — confirmed, but for different proofs.**
+   #12919 / L-meta-8680 received `ACCEPTED (checker exit 0)` yet lost the first-proof race to
+   #12881 and is credited to `willakone`, not ottojung. ottojung's sole site-credited step is
+   L-meta-4655 via merged PR #9466: `data.pequalnp.com/head.json` snapshots at generated_at
+   2026-11-25T09:56:03.603Z and 10:00:46.753Z both report `steps=1`,
+   `first_proof_at=2026-11-25T04:29:27.941Z`, lemma `L-meta-4655`, ref `d37829968ef5`.
+   This corroborates the Judiciary addendum
+   `records/JUDICIARY-ADDENDUM-2026-11-25-cycle-5d88ee98-pnp-credited-step.md:46-51`.
+   Durable state matches: `gaps/L-meta-8680/state.json` is `external_verdict=ACCEPTED`,
+   `state=STALE`, `failure_reason="PR closed without merge"`, while `gaps/L-meta-4655/state.json`
+   is `ACCEPTED`. Site `join.txt` ties credit to merging an accepted proof, so acceptance
+   alone does not earn credit.
+
+4. **Deployed Act 31 implementation — confirmed; restart/recovery continuity — partial.**
+   Implementation is genuinely on main. Recovery is real at the LEASED stage (15 durable
+   reacquisitions) and operationally after agent exit/box restart (staffing records), but
+   there is no durable restart record after SIGNED, PUSHED or PR_OPEN, and no clean re-lease
+   after any of the three real same-PR corrections. The board's last bootstrap update
+   (2026-11-24T10:35Z) saying authoritative acceptance and restart evidence were outstanding
+   was accurate then; acceptance has since arrived, restart evidence has not.
