+## Uncertainties and limits
+
+- No proof content was re-elaborated and no Lean kernel check was re-run; acceptance is taken
+  from the authoritative public checker comments and credit from the public export, as the
+  Founder prescribed. `ref` values on the leaderboard are internal proof refs, not commit SHAs.
+- GitHub stores verdicts in issue comments and `workflow_dispatch` "authoritative" runs, not
+  check-runs/statuses; advisory runs are explicitly non-authoritative
+  (`.github/workflows/advisory.yml`). This was accounted for above.
+- Two real-key smoke tests were skipped (`Otto Jung signing key unavailable in this
+  environment`); GPG fingerprint was derived from signature subpackets because registry
+  access lacks scope. Verified email remains unconfirmed.
+- No single artifact contains every scenario-4 restart observation; the conclusion rests on a
+  scan of all `gaps/*/events.jsonl` for `reacquired` events and their predecessor states.
+- Public ranks move: the Judiciary saw rank 540/542 at 05:06Z; local state at 09:57Z shows
+  rank 545 and margin −217 against the leader. The Founder's #1 objective remains unmet.
+- Board timestamps and durable event timestamps differ by roughly 15 seconds for #4501;
+  both are preserved as reported. Historical test-count claims (17/17, 24/24) match older
+  commits; current main has 53 pipeline tests and 28 allocator tests.
+
+## Recommendation
+
+**KEEP OPEN.** Do not close `R4WYVaWyRxoD911soUtcAo-sciatic`. Five scenarios are satisfied
+(1 with a small receipt caveat, 2 with one unverified sub-item, 3, 5, 6, 8), but scenario 4
+is not satisfied as prescribed and scenario 7 is only half satisfied: the required separate
+restart evidence after SIGNED/PUSHED/PR_OPEN and a clean post-correction restart with no
+abandoned lease are absent from durable state. A genuine credited contribution exists
+(L-meta-4655 / PR #9466), and L-meta-8680 / PR #12919 was authoritatively accepted, but the
+latter lost the race and produced no credit; neither fact closes the acceptance gap.
+This is a finding of missing positive evidence, not an allegation of misconduct. The
+standing mission `IL6wUXaBGXiOmp4aAI8B4c-possesses` must remain open without an explicit
+Founder revocation in any case.
+
+Concrete falsifiable next actions for the accountable owner: (a) produce durable, independently
+checkable restart/reconcile evidence for a candidate interrupted after SIGNED, after PUSHED and
+after PR_OPEN on the exact deployed implementation; (b) show a real correction case ending in
+an authoritative verdict with the lease cleanly released or re-leased and no duplicate PR;
+(c) preserve the #9466 credit evidence and continue the public checked-step objective.
